new colleague will support our MS-ABA, BS-Applied Psychology, and BRIDGE Clinic programs. Responsibilities include teaching graduate and undergraduate courses, providing clinical supervision of students and other duties at the BRIDGE clinic. Appli... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor 99571 Electrical Eng & Renewable Energy Faculty 08/05/2026 Oregon Institute of Technology, a premier public polytechnic university in the Pacific Northwest, and the Electrical Engineering and Renewable Energy Department (EERE) invite applications for the position of Assistant Professor. Oregon Tech is one of the top public regional universities in the western United States and is consistently ranked among the top public universities in the nation by US... View Details Bookmark Student Involvement & Belonging Coordinator 99066 Student Involvement & Belonging Staff 06/22/2026 The Student Involvement & Belonging (SIB) Coordinator creates and supports a holistic student experience responsible for supporting the vision, initiatives, programs, and daily operations for Klamath Falls students. The SIB Coordinator will co-lead Klamath Falls campus Student Involvement & Belonging programs and initiatives; collaborating with partners across the university campus to e... View Details Bookmark Director - Environmental Health and Safety 99030 Environmental Health/Safety Office Staff 06/04/2026 The Director – Environmental Health and Safety (EHS) is a key leadership position within Resilience, Emergency Management and Safety (REMS). This position is responsible for managing the university’s environmental health and safety portfolio ensuring compliance with applicable regulations and implementing practices to mitigate safety-related risks. The Director – EHS routinely collaborates with... View Details Bookmark Instructor of Medical Imaging 99435 Medical Imaging Technology Faculty 05/19/2026 The Medical Imaging Technology (MIT) department at Oregon Institute of Technology (Oregon Tech) seeks applicants for an instructor which is a career track, full-time, nine-month position.Oregon Tech is a public university located in Klamath Falls, Oregon. Klamath Falls is located in the foothills of the Cascade Mountains in southern Oregon and is known as Oregon’s City of Sunshine. It is widely... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Medical Imaging 99435 Medical Imaging Technology Faculty 05/19/2026 The Medical Imaging Technology (MIT) department at Oregon Institute of Technology (Oregon Tech) seeks applicants for a tenure track, Assistant Professor of Medical Imaging.Oregon Tech is a public university located in Klamath Falls, Oregon. Klamath Falls is located in the foothills of the Cascade Mountains in southern Oregon and is known as Oregon’s City of Sunshine. It is widely recognized for... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Communication Studies 00000 Communication Faculty 03/03/2026 The College of Health, Arts, and Sciences at Oregon Tech is seeking enthusiastic and well-qualified teachers for adjunct teaching positions to begin Spring term, April 2026 in Klamath Falls campus teaching accelerated four-week courses at an off-site location serving military students at Kingsley Field.We are looking for instructors who could teach one or more of the following courses:· Communi... View Details Bookmark Administrative Coordinator 99009 Manufacturing & Mechanical Eng Tech Staff 01/12/2026 Under the direction of the Manufacturing and Mechanical Engineering Technology (MMET) Department Chair, the Coordinator will support the development of global engagement programs at Oregon Tech.The Coordinator is responsible for a broad array of office, technical, and administrative or business-related duties in support of campus programs and operations.This part-time (0.50 FTE) position requir... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Applied Behavior Analysis 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 11/19/2027 Oregon Tech is Accepting Applications for Applied Behavior Analysis Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences Department.Humanities and Social Sciences Department at the Oregon Institute of Technology (Oregon Tech) is recruiting a pool of persons for possible part-time adjunct teaching positions for our undergraduate and graduate Applied Behavior Analysis programs. Qualified ap... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor Pool (Mathematics) 00000 Mathematics Faculty 10/27/2025 Oregon Tech Portland Metro is seeking Mathematics Instructors to teach lower division courses, specifically an in-person section of MATH 112 this Winter quarter with the possibility of future courses.The Portland-Metro campus is located in Wilsonville, OR. View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Applied Psychology Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/03/2021 Oregon Tech is Accepting Applications for Psychology Undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences Department.Humanities and Social Sciences Department at the Oregon Institute of Technology (Oregon Tech) is recruiting a pool of persons for possible part-time adjunct teaching positions for our Applied Psychology program. Qualified applicants may be invited to serve as ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Art and Design 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Art and Design undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education and minor in Arts, Literature, and Philosophy courses. Specifically, the... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Literature 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Literature undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions. Hired Adjunct Instructors would be teaching courses that help our students complete their General Education Humanities re... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Philosophy 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Philosophy undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses and minor in Arts, Literature, and Philosophy. Specifically, the dep... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Public Health & Population Health 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Public Health and Population Health undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions for the minor in Medical Sociology and undergraduate degree in Population Health Management. Spec... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Sociology 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Sociology undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses, minor in Medical Sociology, and undergraduate degree in Population H... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Globalization 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Adjunct Instructors to teach online sections of Globalization for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses, including Globalization. The course is taken by a ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, History 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for History undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses. Specifically, the department seeks adjunct instructors to teach: Intro... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Anthropology/Archeology 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Anthropology undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses. Specifically, the department seeks adjunct instructors to teach: ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor Pool, Manufacturing & Mechanical Engineering Technology (MMET) 00000 Manufacturing & Mechanical Eng Tech Faculty 05/07/2025 The Department of Manufacturing and Mechanical Engineering Technology at Oregon Institute of Technology (Oregon Tech) is seeking applications for a part-time adjunct faculty pool for the 2025-2026 academic year. These positions will be based at the Portland-Metro campus in Wilsonville and will be offered on a term-by-term basis. Renewals may be considered annually at the discretion of the depar... View Details Bookmark Campus Safety Officer (Temporary, On-Call) 87518 Security Staff 01/06/2024 Campus Safety invites applications for Temporary, On-Call – Campus Safety Officers.The purpose of this position is to maintain order and the safety of persons and property on the Oregon Tech campus by enforcing the University, state, city and federal rules, regulations and policies relating to the safety and protection of students, staff, faculty and visitors. This is accomplished through emerg... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Marriage and Family Therapy Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 07/31/2024 Oregon Tech is Accepting Applications for Undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences Department.Humanities and Social Sciences Department at the Oregon Institute of Technology (Oregon Tech) is recruiting a pool of persons for possible part-time adjunct teaching positions for our MS in Marriage and Family Therapy program. Qualified applicants may be invited to serve... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor of Manufacturing, Mechanical Engineering and Technology Manufacturing & Mechanical Eng Tech Faculty 09/30/2025 Oregon Tech is Accepting Applications for Undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Department of Manufacturing, Mechanical Engineering and Technology.The Department of Manufacturing, Mechanical Engineering and Technology (MMET) at Oregon Tech (Oregon Institute of Technology) is recruiting a pool of persons for possible part-time Adjunct teaching positions. Qualified applicants may be invited t... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next Contact Us: Office of Human Resources 3201 Campus Dr. Klamath Falls, Oregon 97601 Phone: (541) 885-1120 Email: oithr@oit.edu Website: http://www.oit.edu/hr Policies | Campus Safety | Campus Alerts | Directory | Site Index Connect with us: | | To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
