 accepting applications for Art and Design undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education and minor in Arts, Literature, and Philosophy courses. Specifically, the... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Communication Studies 00000 Communication Faculty 03/03/2026 The College of Health, Arts, and Sciences at Oregon Tech is seeking enthusiastic and well-qualified teachers for adjunct teaching positions to begin Spring term, April 2026 in Klamath Falls campus teaching accelerated four-week courses at an off-site location serving military students at Kingsley Field.We are looking for instructors who could teach one or more of the following courses:· Communi... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Globalization 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Adjunct Instructors to teach online sections of Globalization for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses, including Globalization. The course is taken by a ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, History 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for History undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses. Specifically, the department seeks adjunct instructors to teach: Intro... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Philosophy 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences