ulty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for History undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses. Specifically, the department seeks adjunct instructors to teach: Intro... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor - ABA 99025 Behavioral Sciences Faculty 10/01/2026 Oregon Institute of Technology is conducting a search for a full-time, tenure-track, 9-month faculty position at the rank of Assistant Professor. Our new colleague will support our MS-ABA, BS-Applied Psychology, and BRIDGE Clinic programs. Responsibilities include teaching graduate and undergraduate courses, providing clinical supervision of students and other duties at the BRIDGE clinic. Appli... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Sociology 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Sociology undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses, minor in Medical Sociology, and undergraduate degree in Population H... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Philosophy 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Philosophy undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education courses and minor in Arts, Literature, and Philosophy. Specifically, the dep... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Social Sciences - Klamath Falls Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 07/25/2022 This position will support our Medical Sociology minor and Population Health Management program with coursework in Medical Sociology, Global Health, Research Methods, Current Health Issues, Program Planning, and/or Intro to Sociology.Qualified applicants may be invited to serve as instructors for courses within the department.Candidates interested in adjunct teaching positions should apply onli... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Dental Hygiene 00000 Dental Hygiene Faculty 08/31/2026 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Adjunct Instructors for the Dental Hygiene department.The department of Dental Hygiene is recruiting a pool of Adjunct Instructors for possible part-time teaching positions.Teaching Modality:Adjunct Instructors of Dental Hygiene will be expected to complete in-person/on-campus instruction and/or related in-person/on-campus clinic or labs.Location:The Kl... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor, Art and Design 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/08/2025 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Art and Design undergraduate Adjunct Instructors for the Humanities and Social Sciences (HSS) Department.The Humanities and Social Sciences Department is recruiting a pool of adjunct instructors for possible part-time teaching positions to support the department’s General Education and minor in Arts, Literature, and Philosophy courses. Specifically, the... View Details Bookmark Healthcare Leadership Adjunct Instructor 00000 Humanities and Social Sciences Faculty 08/31/2026 Oregon Tech is accepting applications for Adjunct Instructors in ourMaster of Healthcare Leadership Program. Qualified instructors have the opportunity to teach graduate-level courses in healthcare leadership, leadership theory, interdisciplinary healthcare leadership, healthcare ethics, and health policy. We welcome energetic, creative individuals with a desire to enhance and develop innovativ... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor of Physical Therapy Physical Therapy Faculty 10/20/2022 Oregon Tech is Accepting Applications for Adjunct Instructors for both the foundational sciences portion and the clinical sciences portion of the curriculum.The program is recruiting a pool of persons for possible part-time adjunct teaching positions. Qualified applicants may be invited to serve as instructors for courses within the program.Candidates interested in adjunct teaching positions sh... View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor Pool (Mathematics) 00000 Mathematics Faculty 10/27/2025 Oregon Tech Portland Metro is seeking Mathematics Instructors to teach lower division courses, specifically an in-person section of MATH 112 this Winter quarter with the possibility of future courses.The Portland-Metro campus is located in Wilsonville, OR. View Details Bookmark Adjunct Instructor - Information Technology 99999 Management Faculty 03/15/2023 Oregon Tech is Accepting Applications for Adjunct Instructors to teach undergraduate information technology courses for the Department of Management.The Department of Management at the Klamath Falls campus of Oregon Tech (Oregon Institute of Technology) is recruiting a pool of persons for possible part-time Adjunct teaching positions. Qualified applicants may be invited to serve as instructors ... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next Contact Us: Office of Human Resources 3201 Campus Dr. Klamath Falls, Oregon 97601 Phone: (541) 885-1120 Email: oithr@oit.edu Website: http://www.oit.edu/hr Policies | Campus Safety | Campus Alerts | Directory | Site Index Connect with us: | | To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
